  Description: "COMPANION / RARE / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nContact damage +40. Briefly
    distract nearby ordinary enemies for 2 seconds every 6 seconds. Bosses ignore
    the decoy.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three
    units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA rail-born
    carrier remembering every passenger but denied a choice of destination. They
    left the assigned line after its last station ceased to exist. They want to visit
    somewhere simply because it interests them.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional
    periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories;
    their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated.
    Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nSource: dream shop or
    special reward, subject to hero theme and unlock wave.\r\nBonds: frost, resolve.
    Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star bodies
    merge unless the talent forbids it."
